<p>Hey <%= @user.first_name_or_fallback %>,</p>

<p>
  Your Dabble Me export is ready:
  <%= pluralize(@export.entry_count, "entry") %><% if @export.image_count.positive? %> and <%= pluralize(@export.image_count, "photo") %><% end %>, as a ZIP file.
</p>

<p><strong><%= link_to "Download your export", @export_url %></strong></p>

<p>
  You'll be asked to sign in first, so this email alone can't be used to get your journal.
  The link works until <%= @export.expires_at.strftime("%B %-d, %Y") %>. After that the file is deleted.
</p>

<p>If you didn't ask for this, reply to this email and change your password.</p>
